{"id": "t024-055", "text": "bilal's son's commissioning parade at sandhurst 12 dec, 10am, whole family going incl his grandma who hasnt travelled in yrs. he's so proud, kept showing me pics of him in uniform. bilal said his wife cried when the letter came. his son wants to go into the engineers after. should get bilal's lad a card, something not too cheesy", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "bilal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "commissioning parade at sandhurst", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "12 dec, 10am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandma", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hasnt travelled in yrs", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "bilal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when the letter came"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to go into the engineers", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get bilal's lad a card", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "bilal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r5", "type": "RELATION", "text": "lad", "owner": "p1", "same_as": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t024-058", "text": "helen's grandson Femi starts uni at warwick next mon, computer science, first in the family to go. she's dropping him off sun w his mum, they've bought him enough pot noodles for a yr. helen's worried he wont eat properly. he's doing the freshers rugby trials wed at 4", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "grandson", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Femi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni at warwick", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next mon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "computer science", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "first in the family to go", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dropping him off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sun", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "freshers rugby trials", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "wed at 4", "anchor": "e3"}]}
